218	  // The hook tap reports `event_msg.payload.item.id`, which for a shell command
219	  // is an `exec-<uuid>` unrelated to the call's `call_id` (spec C4). The
220	  // completion item that follows a call is the one that names it; taking the
221	  // NEXT `item_completed` is a reader-local heuristic and nothing below asserts
222	  // on it — it exists so the field is populated rather than invented.
