271	    // `{"task_name": "/root/alpha"}`, a `v1` success is
272	    // `{"agent_id": "...", "nickname": "..."}`, and a REFUSAL is a bare
273	    // sentence that is not JSON at all. Refusal is therefore read from the
274	    // SHAPE of the engine's reply, not from a substring of it: this repository
